      "text": "User filter -> in-{id}-{mac}@ -> CF Worker\nmailparser + mailauth DKIM (`auth = pass`)\nResolves 428 codes & 24h `confirming` apps\nRules -> Haiku classifier (`email_classify`)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User filter -> in-{id}-{mac}@ -> CF Worker\nmailparser + mailauth DKIM (`auth = pass`)\nResolves 428 codes & 24h `confirming` apps\nRules -> Haiku classifier (`email_classify`)",
      "autoResize": true,
