      "originalText": "Unknown required question pauses only affected apps (`needs_review`).\nAnswering once saves a Tier 3 Fact (`q:<id>`) & re-prepares all N unlocked apps.\nAlso surfaces in Profile -> Strengthen your profile (Tier 2 Facts).",
